QuestGuidance.Register("es",441,{
[14081]="70047A54\n1\tEnter the enemy encampment of Fushaum Gund\tThe Orc encampment of Fushaum Gund is located on the eastern slopes of the Slag-hills. You should defeat Orcs in the encampment.\n2\tDefeat Mordor overseers (total: 4)\030Defeat Orcs in Fushaum Gund (total: 10)\tThe Orc encampment of Fushaum Gund is located on the eastern slopes of the Slag-hills. You should defeat Orcs in the encampment.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated many Orcs in Fushaum Gund.\n",
[14082]="7003A4D5\n1\tHabla con el Thane Cútha\tEl Thane Cútha se encuentra en el Salón del Hidromiel de la Atalaya de la Almenara. Meregyth quiere que hables con el Thane Cútha para ver qué tipo de ayuda puede proporcionar a la Frontera de los Pantanos.\n2\tHabla con Meregyth\tMeregyth se encuentra en la Atalaya de la Almenara, cerca del Salón del Hidromiel. El Thane Cútha se ha negado a ofrecer ayuda a ti y a Meregyth o a enviar refuerzos a la Frontera de los Pantanos, pero te ha permitido actuar como consideres oportuno. Debes regresar con Meregyth y darle la desafortunada noticia.\n",
[14083]="700413C1\n1\tSpeak to Arvaethor\tArvaethor asks for you to accompany him into a cavern under the White Mountains and drive the Orkish forces back.\n2\tSpeak with Arvaethor\tArvaethor can be found in the town of Ethring in Ringló Vale. You have returned to Ethring and should speak with Arvaethor.\n",
[14084]="70047A88\n1\tEnter the maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk\tThe maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills. You should destroy Orkish tents in Skoironk.\n2\tDestroy Orkish tents in Skoironk (total: 10)\tThe maggot-hole caverns of Skoironk are located in the Slag-hills. You should destroy Orkish tents in Skoironk.\n3\tCompletado\tDestroyed many tents in Skoironk.\n",
[14085]="70058C84\n1\tAid Agnar with 'Ruthless and Ramshackle'\030Aid Reithvald with 'Embedded in the Battlefield'\030Aid Lági with 'To Fight Another Day'\030Scout the eastern entrance to Ushkútoz\030Scout the western entrance to Ushkútoz\030Scout the eastern pass around Zudramdân\030Scout the western pass around Zudramdân\tAgnar Brokentooth, Lági Helmbiter, and Reithvald Red-ember can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. Zudramdân can be found to the north of the trenches outside Ifbar-athrâkh, and entrances to Ushkútoz can be found hidden in a trench near to Zudramdân and along the western road through Elderslade. Agnar Brokentooth has ordered you to aid the other veterans of the Sixth War of the Orcs and Dwarves in breaking a stalemate in the battlefield around Zudramdân. You should also scout the eastern and western passes by Zudramdân and learn more of the Orkish trench-tunnel, Ushkútoz.\n2\tHabla con Agnar Dienterroto\tAgnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. You have aided Agnar's companions and scouted much of the battlefield in the War of Three Peaks. You should report to Agnar Brokentooth.\n3\tHabla con Agnar Dienterroto\tAgnar Brokentooth can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh. Agnar, Lági, and Reithvald are ready to launch an attack on Ushkútoz in hopes of assassinating the Orc-captain, Kraznákh. You should talk to Agnar Brokentooth when you are prepared.\n4\tTalk to Agnar Brokentooth at the western entrance to Ushkútoz\tAgnar Brokentooth can be found outside the western entrance to Ushkútoz. You have succeeded in defeating Kraznákh and undermining Gorgar's plans to keep the Gabil'akkâ locked in a bloody stalemate. You should talk to Agnar.\n",
[14086]="7000EEE2\n1\tDerrota osos de la tundra en Länsi-mâ (total: 20)\tLos osos de la tundra pueden encontrarse por toda Länsi-mâ. Mika te ha pedido que ahuyentes a varios osos de la tundra.\n2\tHabla con Mika\tMika se encuentra en Norsu-hauta. Ahora que has derrotado a muchos osos de la tundra, deberías regresar con Mika\n",
[14087]="700662BD\n1\tTalk to Cellineth\030Talk to Breniriel\030Talk to Lathlorn\tYou should ask the Avorrim around Edhellond what kind of flowers to put in the now-empty vase.\n2\tTalk to Calendorion\tYou have been advised to talk to an Elf named Calendorion. You can find him at one of the piers in Edhellond, facing the Bay of Belfalas.\n3\tPick beautiful flowers (total: 8)\tCalendorion has asked you to pick a certain type of flower to put in the vase. You can find these beautiful flowers near the piers in Edhellond.\n4\tPlace flowers in the empty vase\tYou have picked enough flowers to fill the vase. You should return to the tower in Edhellond to place them into the vase.\n5\tTalk to Calendorion\tYou should tell Calendorion that he need not worry about the vase's flowers for now. He can be found at one of the piers in Edhellond, facing the Bay of Belfalas.\n",
[14088]="7003E462\n1\tBusca niquebriques en la tierra perturbada (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar niquebriques en el norte del Bosque de Fangorn. El Ucorno de Ramaviva ha pedido tu ayuda para reducir la población de niquebriques antes de que puedan causar más daño a la rica tierra del bosque.\n2\tHabla con el Ucorno de Ramaviva\tHas derrotado a muchos niquebriques y ayudado a preservar la tierra del bosque.\n",
[14089]="70048C79\n1\tHabla con Faeron\tFaeron can be found in Viznak's hideout. You should talk to Faeron.\n2\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be found in his hideout. You should talk to Viznak when you are ready to leave.\n3\tFind the potential allies\030(Optional) Walk with Viznak\tViznak mentioned that the potential allies can be found in a mountain pass to the north-east. You should either walk with Viznak or find the mountain pass on your own.\n4\tAttempt to talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk\tThe mountain pass in north-east Agarnaith is guarded by Ghai-buri-Sêk. You should attempt to talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.\n5\tHabla con Faeron\tFaeron can be found at the mountain pass in north-east Agarnaith. You should talk to Faeron and decide how to proceed.\n6\tReach neutral reputation with the Red Sky Clan\tThe Drúedain in north-east Agarnaith may help you, but you must earn their trust. You should complete tasks for Faeron to improve your standing with the Drúedain.\n7\tHabla con Faeron\tFaeron can be found at the mountain pass in north-east Agarnaith. You should talk to Faeron.\n8\tTalk to Ghai-buri-Sêk\tThe Drúedain outside the mountain pass in north-east Agarnaith seem to be willing to talk to you now. You should try to talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.\n",
[14090]="70037AFF\n1\tSpeak with the half-orc prisoner\tThe half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade, which is behind the Mead Hall. You should speak with the half-orc prisoner.\n2\tSay bye and take your leave\tThe half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade. Say bye and take your leave of the prisoner. EMOTE: Select the target and perform the emote to advance this quest.\n3\tSpeak with the prisoner\tThe half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade. You should speak with the half-orc prisoner.\n4\tThe half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade. You should examine the cell of the prisoner for signs of maltreatment.\t\n5\tSpeak with the prisoner\tThe half-orc prisoner is held captive in the jail of Grimslade. You should speak with the half-orc prisoner.\n6\tWarn the guard at the front gate\030Warn Frithferth\tMen who can help ready the town can be found near the front gate of Grimslade. You should give orders to ready for an attack.\n7\tSpeak with Hildith\tHildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade. You should speak with Hildith.\n",
[14091]="70042F61\n1\tDefeat half-troll executioners in Osgiliath (total: 8)\tHalf-troll executioners can be found near Meneldil's Square in western Osgiliath. Halhir has asked you to defeat half-troll executioners in western Osgiliath to avenge his fallen brothers.\n2\tTalk to Halhir\tHalhir can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath. You have defeated many of the half-troll executioners and should now return to Halhir.\n",
[14092]="70058513\n1\tTalk to Aighrig\tAighrig keeps watch at the overlook near the Greylin River. You should let her know when you are ready to help with her task.\n2\tDefeat Gundabad scouts (total: 5)\030Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side\tGundabad scouts roam near the road east of Annâk-khurfu. The scouts are responsible for signaling attacks on dwarves' supply trains. Defeating them may make the road safer.\n3\tTalk to Aighrig\030Use the whistle to summon Aighrig to your side\tThere are fewer Orcs near the road now, thanks to your efforts and Aighrig's. You should check in with her.\n4\tTalk to Rékkur\tRékkur stands guard at Annâk-khurfu. He will want to hear what you've learned.\n",
[14093]="70058FCD\n1\tDefeat Dourhands at Caivád Sâr (total: 14)\tDourhands can be found at Caivád Sâr and within Tûr Ágal. You have discovered a force of wicked Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr. You should defeat them.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many of the wicked Dourhands occupying Caivád Sâr.\n",
[14094]="70014813\n1\tHabla con Rambi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada\tQuizá quieras preguntarle a alguien en la Cámara de la Encrucijada sobre la armadura que has encontrado.\n",
[14095]="70037BF4\n1\tSearch Uruk-hai Ambushers for stolen goods (total: 6)\tUruk-hai Ambushers can be found along the road to Middlemead to the north-west of Entwade. Kenbert has asked that you recover the goods stolen by the Uruk-hai along the trade route to Middlemead. He believes that the Uruks that patrol the road will have pillaged the carts of passers-by.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. You have recovered the goods stolen by the Uruk-hai along the road to Middlemead. You should now return them to Entwade and speak to Thane Edric.\n",
[14096]="7005A636\n1\tTalk to Mekhnet\tMekhnet has something to say before Lúka can continue fretting.\n2\tTalk to Mekhnet\tMekhnet has decided to strike Atrad-zarakh with you. She waits at Ashmargathâl.\n3\tHabla con Lúka\tYou have returned to Ashmargathâl. Lúka will want to know everything that's happened.\n",
[14097]="70037CE7\n1\tCollect fish-filled nets (total: 6)\tFish-filled nets can be found along the river Entwash to the south-east of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. Magenred has asked that you recover any fish nets that have not been destroyed with the arrival of Orcs in the Kingstead.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. You have recovered a great many fish from the river Entwash. You should now return them to Thane Edric so they can be distributed to his men.\n",
[14098]="70067EED\n1\tRepair damaged supports ([según el diario]/6)\tHûzo asked that you look at the support beams around the fort for signs of wear or cracking. If you find any, Hûzo asked you to repair the damaged supports.\n2\tHabla con Hûzo\tNearly all of the supports you examined were damaged or in a state of disrepair. You should return to Hûzo and inform him of this discovery.\n",
[14099]="7001AF96\n1\tDerrota árboles corruptos en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur (total: 8)\tLos árboles corruptos pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, en las lindes del Bosque Viejo. Bob Cardorojo te pidió que te ocuparas de la amenaza de los árboles corruptos que se encuentran en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, donde los túmulos se encuentran con el Bosque Viejo.\n2\tHabla con Bob Cardorojo en el Alto del Hombre Muerto\tBob Cardorojo está acampado en el Alto del Hombre Muerto. Bob Cardorojo espera tu regreso y la información sobre los árboles que te envió a destruir en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur.\n",
[14100]="70053081\n1\tSearch Orc corpses in the Gladdenmere (total: 15)\030Collect excavated relics (total: 15)\tOrc corpses can be found in the northern reaches of the Gladdenmere. You should search Orc corpses for relics.\n2\tBring the relics to Varthmath in the Gladdenmere\tVarthmath can be found in the Gladdenmere. You should bring the excavated relics to Varthmath.\n",
[14101]="700097E4\n1\tRecupera el cofre de reliquias\tEl cofre de reliquias está en las tiendas del nivel superior de Ost Forod, al norte de Robin Sotopardo. Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que encuentres un cofre de reliquias robadas y lo lleves al montaraz Astiul en Tinnudir, evitando las miradas de la gente hostil de Ost Forod. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con Astiul\tAstiul está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim. Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que hables con Asitul después de entregar el cofre de reliquias robadas.\n3\tHabla con Robin Dunkley\tRobin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al noreste de Tinnudir. El montaraz Astiul te ha pedido que vuelvas con Robin Sotopardo con su agradecimiento por la entrega de reliquias robadas.\n",
[14102]="70025B78\n1\tAcaba con saqueadores de tumbas en Ost Heryn (total: 12)\tOst Heryn está al sur del campamento de Torogethir. Torogethir te pidió que derrotaras a algunos de los saqueadores de tumbas que merodean por Ost Heryn.\n2\tHabla con Torogethir en su campamento en Parth Aduial\tTorogethir se encuentra en su campamento, al norte de Ost Heryn. Torogethir se alegrará de saber que varios saqueadores de tumbas han sido expulsados de Ost Heryn.\n",
[14103]="700331CE\n1\tLleva el tesoro que encontraste a Svanr\tSvanr se encuentra en la escalera de Khadar-zarâm en Nud-melek occidental. Debes llevar el contenido del cofre que examinaste a Svanr.\n",
[14104]="70057F81\n1\tLos perros poco serviciales se pueden encontrar en el Segundo Círculo de Minas Tirith. Deberías correr tras el perro y recuperar el anillo de compromiso.\t\n2\tLleva el anillo de vuelta a la mujer preocupada\tLa mujer preocupada se encuentra en Minas Tirith. Deberías llevar el anillo de vuelta a la mujer preocupada.\n",
[14105]="70020F02\n1\tRecoge yelmos de los desertores (total: 3)\030Recoge balteos de los desertores (total: 3)\030Recoge grebas de los desertores (total: 3)\030Recoge botas de los desertores (total: 3)\tPuedes encontrar desertores dunlendinos por todo Fordirith, aunque especialmente en Lhe Lhechu, al sudoeste de Echad Dagoras. Recoge uniformes de la banda de desertores dunlendinos de Fordirith.\n2\tLleva los uniformes a Dagoras\tDagoras se encuentra en Echad Dagoras, al nordeste de Lhe Lhechu. Deberías llevar a Dagoras los uniformes que has recogido.\n",
[14106]="70062137\n1\tRecolecta athelas (total: 8)\tRendal te ha pedido que le ayudes a conseguir athelas. La athelas crece alrededor del estanque cerca de Sírlond, al este.\n2\tVuelve con Rendal en Sírlond\tHas recogido suficiente athelas. DEberías volver con Rendal en Sírlond.\n3\tHabla con Watcyn\tRendal no ha vuelto, pero el hombre al que ayudaba, Watcyn, quiere hablar contigo.\n4\tExamina los mapas de Rendal\030Examina las armas de Rendal\tWatcyn te ha pedido que busques en las pertenencias de Rendal, al lado de la tienda.\n5\tHabla con Watcyn\tLas pertenencias de Rendal te han dado una idea del tipo de persona que es. Deberías hablar con Watcyn.\n",
[14107]="70062134\n1\tHabla con Rendal\tHabla con Rendal cuando quieras entrar a Gaervarad. Te espera en el exterior.\n2\tAcaba con capitanes de Gaervarad (total: 3)\030Usa el silbato para llamar a Rendal a tu lado\tRendal cree que acabar con algunos capitanes hará que se lo piensen dos veces a la hora de cazar a los desertores. Debes acabar con capitanes en Gaervarad.\n3\tUsa el silbato en Gaervarad para llamar a Rendal\tHas acabado con suficientes capitanes. Deberías hablar con Rendal. Usa el silbato en Gaervarad para llamar a Rengar a tu lado.\n",
[14108]="7003F936\n1\tLleva los Símbolos de Plata a Tothlant\030Recoge los Símbolos de Plata de Dol Amroth (total: 10)\tTothlant te ha pedido que le lleves Símbolos de Plata de Dol Amroth para ayudar a pagar el desbloqueo de Emyn Ernil.\n",
[14109]="7006B7A6\n1\tTalk to Girhâzi\tAmâsu has indicated that you should invite Girhâzi to also see what you discovered. You should talk to Girhâzi.\n2\tComplete Instance: Unlocking History\tGirhâzi has agreed to accompany you and Amâsu to return to the odd wall in the tunnel you discovered. Talk to Girhâzi when you are ready to leave.\n3\tTalk to Girhâzi\tAfter guiding Amâsu and Girhâzi to the salt mine you discovered, they were able to locate and open the lost library, Dubarâkh. You should talk to Girhâzi.\n",
[14110]="7003F937\n1\tLleva los Símbolos de Plata a Harniel\030Recoge los Símbolos de Plata de Dol Amroth (total: 10)\tHarniel te ha pedido que le lleves Símbolos de Plata de Dol Amroth para ayudar a pagar a los trabajadores que desbloquean nuevas áreas de los Senderos de los Muertos.\n",
[14111]="70058462\n1\tGo to the overlook\tThe messenger wants you to follow the road east, past the Hárveg Bridge. Before the road cuts into the Greylin River, there is an overlook to the south. Rékkur believes this next clue may reveal something new, and has asked you to check.\n2\tExamina las huellas\tThe overlook is empty, save for a set of fresh footprints. Examining them could offer some insight.\n3\tTalk to the woman\tAn unfamiliar woman approached you once you defeated the Angmarim at the overlook. Talking to her may answer some of the questions you have.\n",
[14112]="7003A48F\n1\tMadh-fushaum lies just to the south-east of Flodgeheld. Wilberth has asked you to scout around the perimeter of the fortress of Madh-fushaum.\t\n2\tWilberth asked that you create a distraction while he is able to heal, and one way to do that would be to create turmoil in the fortress of Madh-fushaum.\t\n3\tTalk to Wilberth\tWilberth is at Flodgeheld. The White Hand in Madh-fushaum have been distracted by your efforts for some time, and you should now return to Wilberth.\n",
})
